    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Capy Castaway</i></strong><i> is an endearing adventure of unexpected friendship as a capybara pup and a clever crow find themselves working together after a devastating flood.</i> <i>Combine their unique abilities to solve puzzles and help the friends they'll make on this heartwarming journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.poster.avif?t=1754586426\" width=1214 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.webm?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.mp4?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious island, collect trinkets, solve puzzles and wear silly hats as the delightful duo Capy and Corvi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through the mud, discover a fairy ring, or play a game of fetch\u2026 There are tons to play with in this interactive world!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience themes of friendship, family, and finding your way home in this endearing story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide if you want to help the locals and your fellow lost zoo animals. Your choices matter, so the decisions you make will shape the story and can unlock multiple potential endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/500f5e44bfb9c9fe3f5bcffac2be8d5b.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a massive flood upends the lives of several zoo animals, a capybara pup named Capy is washed ashore on a mysterious island. This is a peculiar place where lost things gather and spirits linger, but its secrets are revealed to those who seek them out. Here, Capy meets the young crow Corvi, who becomes their sarcastic but steadfast companion on a life-changing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting old and new friends alike, this heartwarming, narrative-driven adventure will transport players to a place that is both unknown and nostalgic as they explore a world inspired by the memories of Toronto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/02301d2b1aead0bf9ef2d0ee04b69883.poster.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/02301d2b1aead0bf9ef2d0ee04b69883.webm?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/5b797ac59445c0b1f3e8c955cb03f597.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Capy Castaway</i></strong><i> is an endearing adventure of unexpected friendship as a capybara pup and a clever crow find themselves working together after a devastating flood.</i> <i>Combine their unique abilities to solve puzzles and help the friends they'll make on this heartwarming journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.poster.avif?t=1754586426\" width=1214 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.webm?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.mp4?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious island, collect trinkets, solve puzzles and wear silly hats as the delightful duo Capy and Corvi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through the mud, discover a fairy ring, or play a game of fetch\u2026 There are tons to play with in this interactive world!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience themes of friendship, family, and finding your way home in this endearing story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide if you want to help the locals and your fellow lost zoo animals. Your choices matter, so the decisions you make will shape the story and can unlock multiple potential endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/500f5e44bfb9c9fe3f5bcffac2be8d5b.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a massive flood upends the lives of several zoo animals, a capybara pup named Capy is washed ashore on a mysterious island. This is a peculiar place where lost things gather and spirits linger, but its secrets are revealed to those who seek them out. Here, Capy meets the young crow Corvi, who becomes their sarcastic but steadfast companion on a life-changing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting old and new friends alike, this heartwarming, narrative-driven adventure will transport players to a place that is both unknown and nostalgic as they explore a world inspired by the memories of Toronto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/02301d2b1aead0bf9ef2d0ee04b69883.poster.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/02301d2b1aead0bf9ef2d0ee04b69883.webm?t=1754586426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2890240/extras/5b797ac59445c0b1f3e8c955cb03f597.avif?t=1754586426\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p>",
